      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "ボクの母ちゃんが魚が好きなんだけど\n今、病気で寝込んじゃってるんだ。\n好きな魚を食べさせたいけど、触れないから……\nお兄ちゃん、代わりに獲ってきてくれない？",
        "official_en": "My mom's too sick to get out of bed, and I wanna\nmake her favorite seafood dish to help her feel\nbetter, but touching fresh fish really grosses me\nout. Can you help me?",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "UNREVIEWED"
      }
    },
