      },
      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "新鮮な魚を持ってきてくれてありがとう！\nこれで母ちゃんもきっと元気になるよ！\n魚に触れないのに、どうやって料理するのかって？\n香草と一緒に麺包の生地にくるんで蒸し焼きさ。",
        "official_en": "Thank you for the fish! This oughta cheer Mom up!\nNow...how am I supposed to cook this without\ntouching it? Oh, I know! I'll wrap it up in noodle\ndough with some herbs then steam it.",
        "real_en": null
      },
